<title>GREECE: AFTER THE BELL - ASPIS TRADES EX-RIGHTS THURS.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - ASPIS TRADES EX-RIGHTS THURS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said</p>
<p>shares of Aspis Pronoia will trade ex-rights on</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>The terms of the rights issue are one new share per 8.902</p>
<p>existing common or preferred at 1,000 drachmas.</p>
<p>    Company			     Ex-rights opening price</p>
<p>    Aspis				    1,067  common</p>
<p>						   670  preferred</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
